WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.422
No new sounds from here on. Today all eight are mixed up.

2
00:00:03.872 --> 00:00:10.685
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.185 --> 00:00:13.764
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:18.642
Point to the 16 letters, in any order you like. Your child says each sound.

5
00:00:20.026 --> 00:00:20.852
As in moon.

6
00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.123
As in nest.

7
00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:33.481
If your child says the name of a letter, say: that is its name. What is its sound?

8
00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:38.374
If a sound is gone, use the picture and the action. They are the way back to it.

9
00:00:38.824 --> 00:00:44.836
Then the path of words. Each word is the same as the one before, with one letter changed. Watch.

10
00:00:48.265 --> 00:00:49.227
The word is sat.

11
00:00:52.962 --> 00:00:53.956
The word is sit.

12
00:00:57.715 --> 00:00:58.732
The word is sip.

13
00:00:59.632 --> 00:01:04.822
Read the path together once. Then press play on the track for job two, and step away.

14
00:01:05.272 --> 00:01:09.677
Your child reads four words, and draws a line from each one to its picture.
